1
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,498
Ammachi... who is Neha?

2
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,678
Who told you that name?

3
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:39,615
Elias Varkey built that tower in 1946. The town said he stole gold from the church. He didn't.

4
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:46,550
They locked him inside. He died at three in the morning.

5
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:56,737
He swore he'd take back every hour they stole. Every forty years... the clock wakes up.

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:08,760
In 1986, Neha and I heard ten chimes. On the last night, Neha was gone. Everyone forgot her. Except me.

7
00:01:08,810 --> 00:01:11,410
Ammachi, how did you survive?

8
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:16,104
I hid. And he took her instead.

9
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,415
He remembers me.
